          "settings": {
            "heading": "A Guide to Diamond Certification",
            "text": "<p>Diamond certification plays a key role when selecting a diamond. Gaining a clear understanding of how certification works, what’s included in a grading report, and which organisations set the standards allows you to assess a stone’s quality, authenticity, and origin with greater confidence.</p>",
            "heading_size_desktop": 36,
            "text_size_desktop": 18,
            "padding_left_desktop": 380,
