    "blocks_tibAtJ": {
      "type": "_blocks",
      "blocks": {
        "ai_gen_block_0029bb1_KcYBnV": {
          "type": "ai_gen_block_0029bb1",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What is diamond certification?",
            "text": "<p>Diamond certification, also known as diamond grading, is an independent assessment completed by a gemmological laboratory. The diamond is evaluated according to the 4Cs: cut, colour, clarity, and carat weight. The resulting grading report provides clear details about the stone’s quality, helping you make a more informed purchase with greater transparency and confidence.</p>",
            "heading_size_desktop": 30,
            "text_size_desktop": 18,
            "padding_left_desktop": 380,
            "padding_right_desktop": 380,
            "spacing_desktop": 40,
            "heading_size_mobile": 20,
            "text_size_mobile": 14,
            "padding_left_mobile": 40,
            "padding_right_mobile": 40,
            "spacing_mobile": 20,
            "text_alignment": "center",
            "heading_color": "#000000",
            "text_color": "#000000"
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "ai_gen_block_8322f0f_NxbT3a": {
          "type": "ai_gen_block_8322f0f",
          "settings": {
            "padding_top_desktop": 0,
            "padding_bottom_desktop": 25,
            "padding_top_mobile": 5,
            "padding_bottom_mobile": 20
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "ai_gen_block_0029bb1_ttipAX": {
          "type": "ai_gen_block_0029bb1",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Diamond certification terms",
            "text": "<p>A diamond certificate, issued after the grading process, will typically include the following details:</p><p><strong>Grading report number:</strong> A unique identification number assigned to the diamond, allowing the report to be verified through the certifying laboratory.</p><p><strong>4Cs:</strong> A detailed breakdown of the diamond’s cut, colour, clarity, and carat weight.</p><p><strong>Additional grading details:</strong> Depending on the laboratory, the report may also include polish, symmetry, fluorescence, proportions, and measurements.</p><p><strong>Diamond plot: </strong>A diagram showing the location of inclusions and blemishes within the stone.</p><p><strong>Laser inscription: </strong>Some diamonds feature a microscopic laser inscription, often matching the report number, to help identify and verify the stone.</p>",
            "heading_size_desktop": 30,
            "text_size_desktop": 18,
            "padding_left_desktop": 380,
            "padding_right_desktop": 380,
            "spacing_desktop": 40,
            "heading_size_mobile": 20,
            "text_size_mobile": 14,
            "padding_left_mobile": 40,
            "padding_right_mobile": 40,
            "spacing_mobile": 20,
            "text_alignment": "center",
            "heading_color": "#000000",
            "text_color": "#000000"
          },
          "blocks": {}
        }
